    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living cute little Hippo on your desktop, they will always be with you, even while playing game or browsing the web.  Play and feed with them and feel the warm interaction from happy pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special cute little cartoon Hippo interactive animations, gives your desktop some life. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support interacte animation with mouse cursor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding watermelons and playing with hippo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support Alarm list. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support act on top of other windows (Optional). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support Steam Workshop, Share and download Hippo styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with all other software and live wallpapers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight rendering engine with less CPU/GPU and RAM resource usage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support Multi-Languauge </p></li></ul>",
